            "review_title": "Review at Crystal Jade Palace Xuan Thuy",
            "review_text": "rogerl251\nOttawa, Canada285 contributions\n0\nBest Dim Sum Ever\nNov 2024 • Couples\nHaving visited the Crystal Jade Palace in the Lotte Hotel, I was very excited to try the new restaurant in Thao Dien and it didn't disappoint. My wife and I visited for lunch and simply loved it. The atmosphere is wonderful and is somewhat similar to the restaurant at the Lotte. My wife had a set menu and I had the Dim Sum Buffet. The buffet, thankfully, isn't traditional \"get your own\" as you select what you want from a menu and it is brought to the table. Everything we had was amazing and, frankly, it was the best Dim Sum I've had. I would like to give a special thanks to Grace and the rest of the staff who were very professional. I highly recommend Crystal Jade Palace; we'll be back.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 29, 2024",
